  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_56e81ab02910415fba3001d118adb153",
      "statement": "The PSP Connector OneComm Apple service is deployed to three target environments via three repository-root scripts: production (`sync_prod`) targets host `dc` on SSH port 7100, staging (`sync_stg`) targets host `dc` on SSH port 7010, and disaster recovery (`sync_dr_100`) targets host `l` on SSH port 7100.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_dr_100",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:51b27809178895c4e442e8d5f441ace0f0a339806b1549662b45e627c196ad97"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_prod",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:6bb0754fbd73f25c3c23e13ef1d3f4673e194b141d2e1bd52a5428314fefc460"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_stg",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:28d01fda89ba28893db00fb70b404ecb366dd53d6d49875d1a6f50e34ec60b41"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3f8777ecb7a047aba77fbff7b2895e0f",
      "statement": "Production and staging deployments start with a Maven build pinned to JDK 11 (`env JAVA_HOME=/usr/java/jdk-11 mvn clean` followed by `mvn -U package`), which is required because the POM sets maven.compiler.source and target to 11.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://pom.xml#L10-L14",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:63bf033c8376b7eb6a58f8db6cec0d4da40fe94d4d05f3463803a3f5935a8504:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_prod#L1-L1",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4399a7073365ab278b32694bf9fbf8d51eb9d37aa812b18ba15971f91565bbd2:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_stg#L1-L1",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4399a7073365ab278b32694bf9fbf8d51eb9d37aa812b18ba15971f91565bbd2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f76a5f57630d4690bd309ca22305700f",
      "statement": "The Maven build produces a deployable artefact consisting of exactly two directories, `target/classes/` and `target/lib/`: the maven-dependency-plugin copies transitive JARs into `target/lib` during prepare-package, and the maven-resources-plugin copies `src/main/resources/` into `target/classes` during compile.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://pom.xml#L30-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b56b8e9734a8c695b88db7d88e367bba026a0fa2cf90353e5b75799418c953bf:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://pom.xml#L72-L92",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:37f36cd84840bdb571a040096b0b81ae8e00b748e94bdcba694c4a0e452b36c2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_56f30615718c496f85faec4dca718c40",
      "statement": "All three deployment scripts sync the built `target/` tree with the same rsync filter that includes only the `classes` and `lib` directory trees (include rules `classes`, `lib`, `classes/**`, `lib/*`) and excludes everything else, with `--delete` and `--delete-excluded` ensuring a clean remote state.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_dr_100#L1-L7",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:51b27809178895c4e442e8d5f441ace0f0a339806b1549662b45e627c196ad97:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_prod#L2-L8",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:61a27dfaa1ea9446da427634abcd08748d1268ad3f46fe05f13cc2b25da166a6:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_stg#L2-L8",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cbc6402c91a6fb6d953dedc9a3cceb90d7788cbe02ac33df7c8bf622586b2f7d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f484b120003b4cc38d641089cc72df3a",
      "statement": "The deployment scripts rsync into the remote staging area `/root/tmp_deploy/psp-connector-onecomm-apple/`; the live runtime directory is `/opt/psp-connector-onecomm-apple/`, and production/staging apply steps finalize it by running the `setown` script there.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_prod#L8-L10",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ae2595f228d788c26ce2a7983f161026fddd5ec58d124c5c84753cc9cd049d9a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_stg#L8-L10",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:00d4c067afded73cf8b83647d8d77e1196481b268a357e527d3a70963e94fd8e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4422b4b33aee470f8d29140c019ec778",
      "statement": "The production and staging apply phase is manual and operator-driven: after rsync, `ssh` runs `meld` in X11-forwarded mode to review the diff between the staging area and the live `/opt` directory, and only on success runs `/opt/psp-connector-onecomm-apple/setown`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_prod#L10-L10",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7f50edf39a933a7bf30650dfcad73e26e78f60f9bac0cea054673fafca1adf50:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_stg#L10-L10",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a7bb52bf89b6489ccd4bbcade189ae588b5f1a3edac0ec8def7a2ed217cf9d5c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8903ce1b218b47bfa0913ed2cbf1e705",
      "statement": "The disaster recovery script (`sync_dr_100`) performs only the rsync step with no Maven build and no apply phase, relying on an existing `target/` from a prior build to replicate an already-validated artifact set to the DR host `l`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sync_dr_100",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:51b27809178895c4e442e8d5f441ace0f0a339806b1549662b45e627c196ad97"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6e560689e99f4978b191dda7a76ce7e4",
      "statement": "Runtime behaviour is differentiated across environments through Java system properties read via System.getProperty in Config.java (e.g., `uri_prefix`, `onecomm_service_url`, `onecomm_service_timeout`) rather than through distinct built artifacts, allowing staging and production to use different endpoints without editing deployed files.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/pspconnector/provider/onecomm/Config.java",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:db9c6780ef216cac4d35ec77869bb49c977ade60975ae5af65ed16df3e68d65e"
        }
      ]
    }
